# ---------------------------------------------------------------- North-east loop

step The Disruption Ends
  tip Back to the Razormane camp. Geomancers and Defenders hold its eastern half; Kreenig Snarlsnout walks among them. Careful: Razormane Flesheaters and Berserkers (18-19) are elites in the camp's north-east, near Kreenig and the supply crates, and Chol'aruk (20, elite) lies in the cave under Thorn Hill beside them: pull Kreenig and the quilboar away from them one at a time, and leave the cave alone unless you are in a group.
  kill 3269 quest 872.1 only Orc,Tauren,Troll,Undead
  kill 3266 quest 872.2 only Orc,Tauren,Troll,Undead
  collect 5063 quest 872.3 @58.5,27.0 only Orc,Tauren,Troll,Undead

step The Crossroads
  zone The Barrens
  tip Sergra by the inn first, then Helbrim by the north gate, Thork and Darsok on the tower platform, Mankrik by the inn, and Tonga at the south gate last. His seed test waits for the Verog pass at the Stagnant Oasis: go straight on north-west to the Dry Hills.
  turnin 872 only Orc,Tauren,Troll,Undead -- Thork

step Chol'aruk
  when group 97003
  tip These are elite mobs: grouping up is encouraged, look for people to do it with. Chol'aruk (level 20 elite) needs a group of 3 and sits deep in the cave under Thorn Hill, past the Razormane Flesheaters and Berserkers (18-19, elite). Skip it if you are alone.
  collect 276070 quest 97003.1 @57.7,27.4 group 3 only Orc,Tauren,Troll,Undead

step The Crossroads
  zone The Barrens
  tip Sergra by the inn first, then the innkeeper, Helbrim by the north gate, Thork and Darsok on the tower platform, Mankrik by the inn, and Tonga at the south gate last. His seed test waits for the Verog pass at the Stagnant Oasis: go straight on north-west to the Dry Hills. After the spores Helbrim offers Apothecary Zamah, a delivery to Thunder Bluff within 45 minutes: this route doesn't go there, so leave it (Druids take it on the next Crossroads stop, right before their flight to Thunder Bluff).
  turnin 848 only Orc,Tauren,Troll,Undead -- Apothecary Helbrim

