# Forge's route search orders the quests of this guide and its guide writer writes the steps.
# Fixes go into data/route-fixes.json, data/guide-fixes.json or forever-db/corrections, never
# into this file.
# Added here: Letter to Jin'Zil (1060), Sample for Helbrim (1358, from Zinge in the Undercity),
# Protect Kaya (6523, Kaya waits in Grundig Darkcloud's hut at the bend of the Webwinder Path, which
# the route walks past twice; her escort ends at Camp Aparaje on the way back down to Malaka'jin) and
# Kaya's Alive (6401, from Makaba with the escort's hand-in; Tammra Windfield takes it at Sun Rock in
# forever/horde/04-the-barrens).
# Left out: The Harvester (897); Egg Hunt (868, level 22: the Silithid Mounds' Swarmers 21-22 and their
# swarms, 9 recorded deaths, at about 20.5 on the only Field of Giants pass; 0.4.0 level tidy).
# Trial at the Field of Giants (1824, Warriors) runs for 30 minutes: it is taken from Ruga on Jorn's stop after the thunder
# lizards, not on the first Camp Taurajo stop; the antennae come next, then the hand-in, and
# the thunderhawks only after it.
# Apothecary Zamah (853) runs for 45 minutes and Helbrim offers it on the Fungal Spores hand-in: only Druids
# take it, on the next Crossroads stop, and hand it to Zamah on the Thunder Bluff step that follows; the
# route takes nobody else to Thunder Bluff, so the Fungal Spores step's tip says to leave it.

# Horde 12-30 in the order the quest levels fit (2026-11-07): the Barrens come after Silverpine
# Forest, as one stay at 15-21 with the low Stonetalon road (the Webwinder Path and Windshear
# Crag). This guide is the former Barrens 12-16 and the first half of the former Barrens 19-23 in
# one: the Crossroads, Ratchet and the Southsea beach, the oases, the Dry Hills and the Sludge
# Fen, Northwatch Hold, Vrang and Walton, Verog, Camp Taurajo and the Bristlebacks, the Orgrimmar
# trip at 20, Jorn's hunt, Hezrul and Counterattack!, then Seereth's road into Stonetalon. The
# Barrens' level 22-27 quests (Gann Stonespire, Blackthorn Ridge, Betrayal from Within, Weapons of
# Choice) come back with Stonetalon's upper half at 24-26 in
# forever/horde/04-the-barrens, after Ashenvale and Hillsbrad.
#
# Flow: Orgrimmar -> Far Watch Post (Orcs and Trolls: Kargal, Uzzek) -> the Crossroads (flight
# path, bind) -> the Razormane camp -> the Crossroads -> Ratchet (Southsea beach) -> the oases and
# Regthar -> the Dry Hills -> the Sludge Fen console -> the Razormane camp -> the Crossroads ->
# the Dry Hills and Vrang -> Echeyakee -> the Crossroads -> Ratchet
# (Samophlange handed in, Raptor Horns and Baron Longshore taken): the Raptor Grounds' nests and the silver -> Gazlowe's
# Stolen Booty and Baron Longshore at the south end of the beach -> Ratchet -> fly to the Crossroads ->
# the Dry Hills (Serena, Walton) -> Wenikee -> the Sludge Fen shredder
# and Nugget Slugs -> the Boulder Lode Mine -> Wenikee -> the Crossroads -> Verog and Tonga's seed test at the Stagnant Oasis -> Camp Taurajo (flight path) -> the Bristleback camps ->
# Agama'gor -> fly to Orgrimmar for level 20 training -> fly to Ratchet -> Northwatch Hold and Gilthares'
# escort back to Ratchet -> Ishamuhale -> the
# Crossroads, Regthar,
# Hezrul and the snapjaws at Lushwater -> Camp Taurajo: Jorn's thunder lizards and thunderhawks -> the Crossroads:
# Counterattack! -> west to Seereth, Makaba and Malaka'jin -> the Webwinder Path, Ziz Fizziks and
# Windshear Crag -> back down: Kaya's escort from Grundig's hut to Camp Aparaje -> Malaka'jin ->
# Seereth. The next guide goes north to the Mor'shan Rampart and
# Ashenvale.
#
# 0.4.0 level tidy: Raptor Horns (865, level 18) and WANTED: Baron Longshore (895, Baron 16) are taken on the second
# Ratchet stop at about 18, not the first at 16 (the horns on the Raptor Grounds and in Vrang's hills, the Baron
# with Gazlowe's crates at the south end of the beach); The Guns of Northwatch and Free From the Hold (891, 898,
# level 20: Captain Fairmount 20 and her cannoneers 19 with healers and guards, 8 recorded deaths) on the Ratchet
# stop after the Orgrimmar trip, at about 21.
#
# Vrang Wildgore's two quests (Bruised Pride and Lion Hides 95494, Vrang's Game 95507, level 18 from 14) are done on
# the first Dry Hills loop, with the harpies (#1959): his camp, the lions and the traps lie on the way east to
# Echeyakee, and the loop is at about 17 (Savannah Patriarchs 15). Walton's chain (95495, 95621, 95508) stays on the
# second visit with Serena Bloodfeather (876, offered only once Harpy Lieutenants is handed in): Unwelcome Guests
# brings Terry Longdrink (19) up the ridge, two levels over the first loop.
#
# Orcs and Trolls: Far Watch Post first (Conscript of the Horde to Kargal and Crossroads Conscription
# from him: only Warriors pass him at the end of their Durotar guide, everyone else carries 840 here;
# Ak'Zeloth, from Neeru on Silverpine's Orgrimmar stop; Warriors hand Path of Defense to Uzzek), then their own Crossroads step (Meats to Orgrimmar to Devrak; Ride to Orgrimmar
# is left out, as Gryshka would take it at 20, five levels late, and they have the city's flight
# path from the Silverpine guide). Warriors finish
# Thun'grim Firegaze / Forged Steel (1502, 1503) by the Razormane camp; Shamans finish Call of Fire
# (1525-1527): the Fire Tar from the Razormane, Telf Joolam's brazier across the river and Kranal
# Fiss. Tauren Warriors and Shamans come the same way: Mulgore's walk to Orgrimmar past Far Watch
# Post gives them Path of Defense (1498, the Singed Scales from Thunder Ridge) and Call of Fire up to
# 1525 (Kranal, Telf, the Dustwind Gulch pouch), so Warriors hand 1498 to Uzzek on the walk from
# Orgrimmar and Shamans take the same Fire Tar, Telf and Kranal steps; no Durotar trip from the
# Crossroads of their own.
#
# Background goals: the Raptor Heads and Plainstrider Beaks are collected on the way (#1135), each
# with a finish step before its hand-in.
#
# Group quests: WANTED: Bruuz (92706, `when group 92706`, #639) and Gerenzo's Orders (1090, `when group 1090`,
# #1370: Piznik's five-minute defence in the Windshear Mine, quest level 22, lost solo at 23 and 25 in players'
# recordings). Owatanka (884), Lakota'mani (883)
# and the Rogue's Mission: Possible But Not Probable (2478, Gallywix is elite) are optional.
#
# Dropped: Chen's Empty Keg part 2 and 3 (821, 822): part 2's tusks, kidneys and horn are drops
# spread over three areas of this guide, walked through and come back for. Deepmoss Spider Eggs
# (1069): few recorded players hand it in.
#
# Carried on, finished: Report to Kadrak (6541, the next guide's first stop) and The Ashenvale Hunt
# (6382, Night Run). Carried on, to hand in: Further Instructions (1094), taken from Ziz with the
# blueprints' hand-in at 21; Sputtervalve stands beside Ratchet's flight master, where
# forever/horde/04-the-barrens lands at about 26 (830 XP for a few steps). Kaya's Alive (6401) goes to
# Tammra Windfield on 04-the-barrens' first Sun Rock stop.
#
# Class quests: Warriors take Speak with Ruga / Trial at the Field of Giants / Speak with Thun'grim
# (1823-1825) on the Orgrimmar trip at 20 and gather the Twitching Antennae at the Field of Giants
# after Jorn's thunderhawks; they vanish 15 minutes after they drop (ItemSparse 7119, 900 s), so
# Ruga at Camp Taurajo takes them at once. Shamans: Call of Water 1528 (Orgrimmar), 1530 (Islen
# by Ratchet), 1535 at Brine south of Camp Taurajo; 1536 waits at the Spring Well beside Tarren
# Mill. Warlocks: the succubus chain (1507-1513), The Binding on the Orgrimmar stop of the next
# guide. Troll Priests Shadowguard (5680, Ur'kyo); Undead Priests Dark Sacrifice (5646, Ur'kyo to
# Aelthalyste in the Undercity on the Hillsbrad guide's stop). Rogues The Shattered Salute / Deep
# Cover / Mission: Possible But Not Probable (2460, 2458, 2478 optional). Tauren and Skyborne Druids: Trial of
# the Lake at 16 and Cure Poison (6126-6130), Cat Form at 20 (98340-98362; 98341 for Skyborne).
# Trial of the Sea Lion (30) is taken at 16 and carried: the Sludge Fen's half pendant on this
# guide's walk north, the Silverpine half on the ride to Hillsbrad at 21 (its lockbox gives it only
# while the quest is in the log, #1386), the pendant joined and handed in from the Undercity at the
# end of forever/horde/06-hillsbrad-foothills, as Aquatic Form (31) at Turak.
#
# Class training: Orgrimmar at 20 for everyone but Druids and Paladins, who fly to Thunder Bluff in
# that trip's place instead (Orgrimmar has no trainer of theirs, and Rilli Greasygob's 3923 is taken
# only by the classes that go there): Paladins learn its flight path by Camp Taurajo and train,
# Druids train at 16 and at 20, the second time with Cat Form and Cure Poison in Moonglade on the
# same trip; both fly on to Ratchet from Thunder Bluff.

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- Far Watch Post

# Orcs and Trolls take Crossroads Conscription (842) from Kargal, and Warriors hand Uzzek the Singed
# Scales from Thunder Ridge (1498): Far Watch Post is on the road from Orgrimmar to the Crossroads.

step Far Watch Post
  only Orc,Troll
  zone The Barrens
  when onquest 840
  turnin 840                          -- Kargal Battlescar: Conscript of the Horde, from Durotar

step Far Watch Post
  only Orc,Troll
  zone The Barrens
  tip Leave Orgrimmar by the main gate and follow the road south through Durotar, then west over the Southfury River bridge: Far Watch Post sits just above it on the Barrens side. Kargal Battlescar, Ak'Zeloth and Uzzek stand together.
  accept 842 only Orc,Troll
  accept 1502 only Orc,Troll,Warrior

step Far Watch Post
  only Orc,Troll
  zone The Barrens
  when onquest 809
  turnin 809                          -- Ak'Zeloth, beside Kargal: from Neeru Fireblade in Orgrimmar

