step Trial of the Lake
  only Tauren,Skyborne,Druid
  zone Moonglade
  tip Dendrite Starblaze stands upstairs in his building in Nighthaven: go up inside, the arrow cannot tell the floors apart. The Shrine Baubles lie on the bed of Lake Elune'ara and fade within minutes: swim one straight to the Shrine of Remulos on the north-west shore, use it there and speak to Tajarri. Trial of the Lake runs on a timer: no teleport or Hearthstone until Tajarri has it.
  turnin 27 only Tauren,Skyborne -- Dendrite Starblaze
  turnin 6126 only Tauren,Skyborne
  accept 6127 only Tauren,Skyborne -- The Principal Source: Dreadmist Peak, next guide
  accept 28 only Tauren,Skyborne
  collect 15877 x1                    -- Shrine Bauble, from a Bauble Container in the lake
  use 15877 @36.0,41.4                -- At the Shrine of Remulos
  interact 177788 quest 28.1 only Tauren,Skyborne
  collect 15877 quest 28.2 only Tauren,Skyborne
  turnin 28 only Tauren,Skyborne -- Tajarri, at the Shrine of Remulos
  accept 30 only Tauren,Skyborne               -- Trial of the Sea Lion, carried: one half pendant in the Sludge Fen in this guide, the other underwater off Silverpine on the way to Hillsbrad at 21; the pendant is handed in after Hillsbrad
  fly "Thunder Bluff"                 -- Bunthen Plainswind in Nighthaven flies druids there

