  accept 3923 only Warrior,Hunter,Rogue,Priest,Shaman,Mage,Warlock -- Keep it: Rilli Greasygob is in Orgrimmar's Valley of Honor, on the Orgrimmar trip at 20

step the Crossroads
  zone The Barrens
  tip South down the road to the Crossroads: Darsok stands on the tower platform, Tonga Runetotem at the south gate.
  turnin 6128 only Tauren,Skyborne,Druid       -- Tonga Runetotem
  accept 6129 only Tauren,Skyborne,Druid       -- He gives you the Curative Animal Salve

step Verog the Dervish
  zone The Barrens
  tip Verog doesn't wander on his own: he comes out when you kill the Kolkar centaurs at the Stagnant Oasis, south-east of the Crossroads. Keep killing them around the oasis until he appears. Test Tonga's seeds at the bubbling fissure on the oasis' east bank while you are there.
  collect 5023 quest 851.1 only Orc,Tauren,Troll,Undead
  kill 12296 quest 6129.1 "Use the Curative Animal Salve on Sickly Gazelles" only Tauren,Skyborne,Druid -- Sickly Gazelle: use the Curative Animal Salve on them; they roam the plains all around the Crossroads

step Bristleback camps
  tip The Bristleback quilboar camps spread over the plains north of Camp Taurajo, either side of the Gold Road. Mankrik's wife lies at their north edge, on your way south. Leave the quilboar for now: Mangletooth in Camp Taurajo wants the same camps cleared. Lakota'mani, a grey kodo, sometimes wanders here: his hoof starts a quest.
  talk 10668 quest 4921.1 @49.3,50.3 only Orc,Tauren,Troll,Undead

step Camp Taurajo
  tip Follow the Gold Road south to Camp Taurajo.
  accept 878 only Orc,Tauren,Troll,Undead -- Mangletooth, in the cage
  getfp "Camp Taurajo" npc 10378      -- Omusa Thunderhorn

