step Northwatch Hold: kill these as you meet them
  zone The Barrens
  tip South along the beach past the pirate camp to Northwatch Hold, on the coast. The Theramore Marines and Preservers (15-16) drop the medals; Captain Fairmount (20) and the two cannoneers (19) stand in the keep and on its walls.
  tip Careful: Each named target is linked to a healer and guards, and Fairmount has three extra marines with her. Killing the healer first makes the fight easier.
